questions.questionText:
What is the output of the following code on a circular singly linked list (insertion functions of the
notes)?
struct Node *last = NULL;
last = insertAtBeginning(last, 10);
last = insertEnd(last, 20);
last = insertAtBeginning(last, 5);
last = insertEnd(last, 30);
printf("%d %d", last->data, last->next->data);

